sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MySQL

    Customer->>UI: Open app and browse collections
    UI-->>Customer: Show products and details

    alt Register
        Customer->>UI: Submit signup form
        UI->>API: POST /api/register
        API->>DB: Insert user
        DB-->>API: Success
        API-->>UI: Registration success
        UI->>LS: Save user session
        UI-->>Customer: Redirect to home
    else Login
        Customer->>UI: Submit login form
        UI->>API: POST /api/login
        API->>DB: Validate user
        DB-->>API: User record
        API-->>UI: Login success
        UI->>LS: Save user and role
    end

    Customer->>UI: Add item to cart
    UI->>LS: Save cart items
    LS-->>UI: Cart updated event
    UI-->>Customer: Cart badge updated

    Customer->>UI: Proceed to checkout
    UI->>LS: Read cart and saved address
    UI-->>Customer: Checkout summary

    alt Buy flow
        Customer->>UI: Fill address and shipping
        UI-->>Customer: Navigate payment page
    else Rent flow
        Customer->>UI: Select rental dates and upload ID
        UI-->>Customer: Navigate payment page
    end

    Customer->>UI: Choose payment method and pay
    UI-->>Customer: Processing and success state
    UI-->>Customer: Order confirmed options

    Customer->>UI: Track order
    UI-->>Customer: Status timeline

    Customer->>UI: Open contact support and submit issue
    UI-->>Customer: Ticket submitted confirmation
